.TH JAEGER-CTL 1 "2026-11-15" "zdots" "zdots manual"
.SH NAME
jaeger-ctl \- Service Lifecycle:
.SH SYNOPSIS
See OPTIONS below (generated from \fBjaeger-ctl --help\fR).
.SH OPTIONS
.nf
Usage: jaeger-ctl <command> [--json]

Service Lifecycle:
  install   Download + sha-verify Jaeger v2.23.0 and register launchd
  start     Load and start Jaeger
  stop      Unload and stop Jaeger
  restart   stop then start
  status    Show Jaeger state and process info
  health    Exit 0 if Jaeger UI endpoint responds, else 1
  logs      Tail the Jaeger log
  validate  Validate etc/jaeger.yaml

Options:
  --json      Output status/health as JSON
  -h, --help  Show this help

Endpoints:
  UI:        http://127.0.0.1:16686 (https://jaeger.localhost via nginx)
  OTLP gRPC: 127.0.0.1:14317 (downstream of otel-collector)
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
agent-guide(1), zdots-doctor(1)
